1263
01:04:46.048 --> 01:04:47.633
-Thanks.
-Yeah, it's good.

1264
01:04:49.135 --> 01:04:51.971
Nice! Like your style, Keith Nash.

1265
01:04:52.054 --> 01:04:53.931
-I gotta go.
-Catch you later.

1266
01:04:54.015 --> 01:04:56.726
-Bye, Paul.
-Don't get caught.

1267
01:04:57.852 --> 01:05:00.062
