-Shit!
-They're right behind me!

1293
01:06:42.123 --> 01:06:44.667
-Hurry up, buttcracks!
-Hey, look. It's that nerd.

1294
01:06:44.750 --> 01:06:46.335
Ohhhh!

1295
01:06:46.419 --> 01:06:49.672
-Oh-ho! Yeah!
