1296
01:06:49.755 --> 01:06:51.590
Keith Nash. Punch it!

1297
01:06:51.674 --> 01:06:54.301
-Oh! Oh! Oh!
-What happened? Who was that kid?

1298
01:06:54.385 --> 01:06:56.220
