1396
01:12:07.906 --> 01:12:12.745
We're here with the alien
that killed your dog 60 years ago.

1397
01:12:16.081 --> 01:12:18.876
-Let's go. Let's just go.
-[door opens]

1398
01:12:18.959 --> 01:12:21.086
